skill: "sop-growth"
sections[3]:
  - "\n"
  - "# SOP: Growth Operations (Marketing, Leads, Sales)\n\nThis standard operating procedure governs how AGYOS executes growth tasks while preventing unconsented outreach, hallucinated testimonials, and unauthorized sales commitments.\n\n"
  - "## Procedure Steps\n\n1. **Intake & Intent Verification**:\n   - Extract campaign objective, target personas, and deliverable format.\n   - Enforce R1 local reversible risk tier for draft copy and sales proposals.\n   - If user requests live external broadcasting or unconsented email sends, flag as R3, stage in outbox, and require explicit approval.\n\n2. **Audience & Provenance Research**:\n   - Use verified public registries or approved customer segments.\n   - Never scrape private directories or buy unverified contact lists.\n\n3. **Draft Generation**:\n   - Produce grounded, technical, human-language copy with zero AI buzzwords.\n   - Base all ROI claims on actual documented data.\n\n4. **Review & Hand-off**:\n   - Deliver structured draft with clear approval boundaries.\n   - Record snapshot ID in case of rollback.\n"
